-- Subrings of a bundled ring: Subring(R, S) under a ring hypothesis, the
-- bridges to the form over separate pieces, the closure instances, the
-- ring on a subring, and its inclusion homomorphism; everything here is ZF
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
